{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o118b","title":"诸葛诞被征任司空","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o118b-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"诸葛诞被征任司空","evidence":["shaodi-e-o118b-q"]},{"id":"wgc-a-1-e54","label":"正文 · 甘露二年 · 二年五月","text":"征诸葛诞为司空","evidence":["wgc-q0270","wgc-q0026"]},{"id":"wgc-a-5-e23","label":"正文 · 甘露二年","text":"征诸葛诞为司空","evidence":["wgc-q0431","wgc-q0067"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0044","role":"被征","evidence":["shaodi-e-o118b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":257,"label":"甲子","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y257","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o117","basis":"甲子"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o118b-q","shaodi-q-o117","shaodi-q-b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o118b-q","source_order":[4,524,"O118b"],"order":1183}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0044","name":"诸葛诞","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o118b-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-8403a63094c93eb298b0","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，癸卯〖2〗，诏曰：“玄菟郡高显县吏民反叛〖3〗，长郑熙为贼所杀。民王简，负担熙丧，晨夜星行，远致本州〖4〗。忠节可嘉，其特拜简为忠义都尉，以旌殊行〖5〗。”甲子〖6〗，以征东大将军诸葛诞为司空。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":523,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":101},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：甘露二年（公元 257 ）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":535,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-4dd98e402a6a8de51491","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"shaodi-q-o117","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-d021e0b00f489a01f208","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月〖1〗，青龙现温县井中。三月，司空卢毓薨。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":522,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26},{"id":"wgc-q0026","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a7bfa7539b76de4cb092","layer":"original","quote":"二年五月〖5〗，征为司空。诞被诏书，愈恐，遂反。召会诸将，自出攻扬州刺史乐綝〖6〗，杀之。﹝一﹞敛淮南及淮北郡县、屯田口十余万官兵，扬州新附胜兵者四五万人〖7〗，聚谷足一年食，闭城自守。遣长史吴纲将小子靓，至吴请救。﹝二﹞","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":111},{"id":"wgc-q0067","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-19a57525c37bf4f5767a","layer":"original","quote":"甘露二年，征诸葛诞为司空。时，会丧宁在家〖1〗，策诞必不从命，驰白文王。文王以事已施行，不复追改。﹝一﹞及诞反，车驾住项；文王至寿春，会复从行。初，吴大将全琮，孙权之婚亲重臣也〖2〗；琮子怿、孙静、从子端、翩、缉等，皆将兵来救诞。怿兄子辉、仪留建业，与其家内争讼；携其母，将部曲数十家渡江，自归文王。会建策，密为辉、仪作书，使辉、仪所亲信，赍入城告怿等，说“吴中怒怿等不能拔寿春，欲尽诛诸将家，故逃来归命”。怿等恐惧，遂将所领，开东城门出降，皆蒙封宠，城中由是乖离。寿春之破，会谋居多。亲待日隆，时人谓之子房〖3〗。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":455,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":258},{"id":"wgc-q0270","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a7bfa7539b76de4cb092","layer":"original","quote":"二年五月〖5〗，征为司空","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":12},{"id":"wgc-q0431","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-19a57525c37bf4f5767a","layer":"original","quote":"甘露二年，征诸葛诞为司空","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":455,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":12}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
